arget":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/application-manager.md","line":1063},{"title":"using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":1067},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":1094},{"title":"Minimal user permissions","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md","line":1154},{"title":"Create a data extension for your Contacts Counts report","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md","line":1172},{"title":"Create a user for accessing the Salesforce Marketing Cloud SOAP API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md","line":1193},{"title":"Create a user for accessing the Salesforce Marketing Cloud SOAP API","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md","line":1194},{"title":"Create a data extension for your Contacts Counts report","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md","line":1196},{"title":"software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":1215},{"title":"Subscription exclusions for SaaS and SSO applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/subscription-exclusions.md","line":1227},{"title":"Create a child alias to set up multiple integration profiles","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/create-child-alias-saas.md","line":1229},{"title":"Review a software reclamation rule","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/add-reclamation-rule-sub.md","line":1231},{"title":"Create entitlements in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/track-software-rights.md","line":1235},{"title":"Create entitlements in workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/create-entitlements-workspace.md","line":1236},{"title":"Create entitlements using the guided walk-through","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/guidedwalk-workspace.md","line":1237},{"title":"License Workbench","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-license-workbench.md","line":1239},{"title":"License usage view","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/sam-workspace-workbench.md","line":1239},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in Software Asset Management classic","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/t_RunReconciliation.md","line":1241},{"title":"Run software reconciliation in the workspace","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-asset-management/software-asset-management/run-recon-workspace.md","line":1242},{"title":"Software Asset Management","target":"c_SoftwareAssetMgmt","line":1246},{"title":"SaaS License Management","target":"sam-subscription-management","line":1247},{"title":"Using Software Asset Workspace","target":"using-sam-workspace","line":1248},{"title":"Software Asset Workspace","target":"sam-workspace","line":1249},{"title":"Software models","target":"c_CreatingSoftwareModels","line":1250}],"metadata":{"title":"Integrate Salesforce Marketing Cloud using basic authentication","description":"Integrate your ServiceNow instance with Salesforce Marketing Cloud by using basic authentication.Create a user with which you can access the Salesforce Marketing Cloud SOAP API. The SOAP API enables you to retrieve records from your Salesforce Marketing Cloud data extensions and get information about your Salesforce Marketing Cloud users.Create a Contacts Counts report to retrieve and display the total number of billable contacts in your Salesforce Marketing Cloud account.Create a data extension to store your Contacts Counts report data on your Salesforce Marketing Cloud instance.Create an automation to automatically import Contacts Counts report data into your data extension after the report is generated.After you create the Contacts Counts report, data extension, and automation, you can retrieve report data between your scheduled report and automation jobs by running these jobs manually.Create an integration profile by using basic authentication to track software subscriptions and optimize stale licenses for the Salesforce Marketing Cloud service.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.html","release":"australia","product":"SaaS License Management","classification":"saas-license-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":28,"breadcrumb":["Integrating with Salesforce Marketing Cloud","Integrate with SaaS applications","SaaS License Management","Software Asset Management","IT Asset Management"],"tags":["#it-asset-management","#saas","#license-management","#discovery","#optimization","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[728,733]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/it-asset-management/saas-license-management/integrate-sfmc-basicauth.md"},
